e same\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-74-quantity. Define what proves a partition disjoint/exhaustive, how unallocated\n--\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:79:### G13. Multiple clocks are identified without complete historical query rules\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-80-\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-81-Requirements: MC05, MC19, MC25. Refines G2, G4 and G10.\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-82-Evidence: [time and views](/home/chakwong/python/AccDSL/docs/design/chapters/02-history.tex:80)\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-83-and [EvidenceView](/home/chakwong/python/AccDSL/docs/design/chapters/11-contracts.tex:92).\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-84-\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-85-Storing dates and supersession links does not specify which assertion wins a\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-86-query. The design needs precise rules for incomplete publication timestamps,\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-87-conflicting available filings, selective restatements, changed accounting\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-88-bases and calendars, and different investor-information versus system-version\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-89-queries. Prospective estimate changes and retrospective corrections are\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-90-delegated to future packages without a complete transition example.\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-91-\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-92-Required evidence: a multi-date example with explicit publication, ingestion,\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-93-economic and reporting times, original and revised amounts, and the exact\n--\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:124:### G4. The first corporate accounting package is an inventory of duties\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-125-\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-126-Evidence: [initial corporate scope](/home/chakwong/python/AccDSL/docs/design/chapters/08-modules.tex:41)\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-127-and [report production](/home/chakwong/python/AccDSL/docs/design/chapters/07-execution.tex:209).\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-128-\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-129-Sales, inventory, payroll, fixed assets and working capital are named, but\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-130-recognition, measurement and transition rules are not supplied as a coherent\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-131-reference package. There is no complete company example joining accruals,\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-132-settlements, cost of sales, depreciation, closing, cash-flow classification\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-133-and changes in equity. Consolidation, foreign-currency translation and\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-134-restatement have sound stated requirements but lack equivalent numerical\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-135-specifications. The tests for these operations mostly describe desired\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-136-properties without complete inputs and expected outputs.\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-137-\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-138-Required repair: provide one deliberately bounded corporate profile with an\n--\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:145:### G5. No complete filing-to-forecast reference case tests the central workflow\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-146-\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-147-Evidence: [proposed demonstrator](/home/chakwong/python/AccDSL/docs/design/chapters/01-purpose.tex:128),\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-148-[ingestion](/home/chakwong/python/AccDSL/docs/design/chapters/07-execution.tex:6),\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-149-and [example request](/home/chakwong/python/AccDSL/docs/design/chapters/11-contracts.tex:234).\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-150-\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-151-The document proposes a real company and a synthetic company but does not\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-152-instantiate either as a full disclosure package. There is no named filing\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-153-set with source passages, extracted records, alternative readings, resolved\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-154-cross-references, history constraints and resulting conditional statements.\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-155-The mathematical example starts after the consequential interpretation work\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-156-has already been supplied by hand.\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-157-\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-158-Required repair: add a complete synthetic fixture whose hidden history is known\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md-159-and a bounded, named real annual/interim disclosure case. Show representative\nglobal-scientific-coding-agent-policy.md\nhumanizer-ai-writing-patterns.md\nscholarly-literature-audit-policy.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
